    given-names: Johnathon
    affiliation: Independent researcher
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnathonkillaly/pretraining-speed-experiments"
url: "https://github.com/johnathonkillaly/pretraining-speed-experiments"
abstract: >-
  Local Apple M4 Max MLX and RTX 4070 Laptop CUDA pretraining-performance
  experiments covering sparse expert dispatch, optimizer state and update cost,
  recurrent depth with truncated backpropagation, fused loss, activation
  checkpointing and physical sequence batching. Includes negative results,
  failed numerical gates, corrected measurement errors, scalar measurements,
  historical sources and explicit reproduction limitations.
keywords:
  - pretraining
  - MLX
  - Apple Silicon
  - mixture of experts
  - Muon
  - recurrent depth
  - truncated backpropagation
  - CUDA
  - negative results
